# Generated simulator decks and results (regenerate with the writeCMG*/writeEclipse* routines)
*.inc
*.dat
*.DATA
*.grdecl
*.sr3
*.out
*.irf
*.mrf
*.rst

# Logs and MATLAB editor autosaves
*.log
*.asv
*.m~

# Test and example artifacts
**/tests/output/
**/tests/output_*/
**/tests/mcp_work/
**/examples/output/

# Web app runtime state
web/work/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ...but the web self-test fixtures are inputs, not generated output:
# selftest.html fetches these at runtime, so they must stay tracked
# even though they match the deck patterns above.
!web/static/testdata/**
